{
  "statement": "Ethical and compliance considerations are integral to the library management system. RES-01 ensures we comply with data protection regulations, safeguarding user data through encryption. RES-02 promotes inclusivity by providing an accessible interface for all users. RES-03 enhances accountability by logging user actions related to borrowing. RES-04 enforces borrowing policies for fairness. RES-05 notifies members of overdue books, promoting responsibility. RES-06 allows members to voice issues, ensuring transparency. RES-07 provides annual reports on usage statistics, fostering trust and accountability in operations. Together, these requirements uphold ethical standards and compliance necessary for a responsible library system.",
