      "ids": ["TRU-03"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "TRU-03's encryption for personal information may conflict with RES-01 if additional resources are required for compliance."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["TRU-01"],
      "type": "redundant",
      "description": "TRU-01's focus on authentication overlaps with RES-04's requirement to enforce borrowing policies, creating redundancy."
    },
    {
